add([(1904,'figure','Virtual RGB camera window, Gazebo scene and RViz map; preconfigured world/map caption.')],'sim-views','Simulation views','Which interpretation fits the three views on page1904?',['A virtual camera image, a simulated world and an RViz spatial map visualization of the configured scenario.','Three independent photographs from the physical corridor robot.','A source-code editor, a PID gain table and a hardware timing trace.','A training-loss plot, an IMU Allan-variance plot and a confusion matrix.'],'The page visibly combines virtual camera, Gazebo world and RViz map views.',['The caption explicitly identifies simulation and a preconfigured world/map.','None of the displayed panes is that code/gain/timing set.','These are not the displayed statistical plots.'],typ='diagram')
